      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax-H3-Image edit (EditUtils)\n\n**Model files** (put them under `ComfyUI/models/`)\n\n- `diffusion_models/minimax_h3_image_pruned_w4a8.safetensors` (or the bf16/fp8 release)\n- `text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors` (CLIP type **minimax**)\n- `vae/minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors`\n\n**Sampling contract (from the checkpoint, not from a node)**\n\n- **6 steps** — the checkpoint carries a 7-point PDD sigma grid (`pdd_sigmas`), so\n  `steps=6` lands exactly on the distilled grid. Other counts interpolate off-grid.\n- **cfg 1.0** — the guidance is baked into the weights; the negative just needs to\n  exist (`ConditioningZeroOut`).\n- `euler` / `simple` is what the official workflow uses; the target noise is one\n  24-channel latent frame.\n\n**References**\n\n`MinimaxH3ImageConfigPreparer_EditUtils` per image; chain them through `configs`.\nThe prompt refers to them as `<Picture 1>`, `<Picture 2>`, ... (the tokenizer\nemits `\"Picture n: \" + vision block`; do not type the labels yourself).\n\n**Sizes**\n\n- references: short edge 1024 px (clamped to 2048), snapped to 32 px — this node's\n  `ref_short_edge` / `ref_max_short_edge`;\n- target: 4-20 MP. The sampled latent is the main image's reference grid times\n  `scale_up`; here `scale_up = 2` turns a ~1 MP reference into a ~4 MP target\n  **without** upscaling the reference. Leave it at 1.0 to sample at the\n  reference size (a 1 MP target is rendered as poster-like artifacts).\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        800,
        430
      ],
      "size": [
        330,
        300
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 14,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## H3I vs H3\n\n`MiniMax-H3-Image` is the **image** model (`image_model=\"minimax_h3_image\"`,\none 24ch latent frame). The H3 **video/audio** model (`minimax_h3`) is a\ndifferent graph and does not read `minimax_refs`.\n\n`MinimaxH3ImageEditApply_EditUtils` is **not needed** here: ComfyUI's\n`MiniMaxH3Image` already consumes `minimax_refs` natively. Add it only as a\nguard/diagnostic (it prints the PDD grid and the step/CFG contract).\n"
      ]
    }
